From e458c057ccad1525c0f4011bb31e644b3954245c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:53:34 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(post): Fanuc option to write the stock as a Manual
 Guide i blank

The Fanuc post has a new option, manualGuideBlank (off by default).
With it on, the post writes one blank block after G20/G21 and before
the first G90 G54 and tool change: G1902 for a box stock, G1900 for a
round bar along Z on the work origin. Any other stock posts a comment
that says why, not a block.

The app stream states what the stock box bounds: PARAM StockShape,
StockShapeBottom and StockShapeDiameter (a new posting module). The
Klartext post ignores them (its positive PARAM list). A Robodrill
tester kit is pinned byte for byte to the post output.

Fixes #2769

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
